    {
      "source": "Map the <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a> object to apply field name mapping using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>the type to read</code></a>.",
