    {
      "source": "Map a <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a> object into <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/Condition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Condition</code></a> and consider value/<code>NULL</code> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/binding/Bindings.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core.binding\"><code>Bindings</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a> 对象映射为 <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/Condition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Condition</code></a>，并考虑值/<code>NULL</code> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/binding/Bindings.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core.binding\"><code>Bindings</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0 in favor of <a href=\"#getMappedObjects(org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql.Expression,org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping.RelationalPersistentEntity)\"><code>getMappedObjects(Expression, RelationalPersistentEntity)</code></a> where usage of\n            <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Embedded.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>embeddable properties</code></a> can return more\n            than one mapped result.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，推荐使用 <a href=\"#getMappedObjects(org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql.Expression,org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping.RelationalPersistentEntity)\"><code>getMappedObjects(Expression, RelationalPersistentEntity)</code></a>，因为使用<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Embedded.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>可嵌入属性</code></a>可能会返回多个映射结果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"QueryMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.query\"><code>QueryMapper</code></a> with the given <a href=\"../convert/R2dbcConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>R2dbcConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../convert/R2dbcConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert\"><code>R2dbcConverter</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"QueryMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.query\"><code>QueryMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
